### Third-Party & Upstream Licenses

This repository and its standalone releases integrate, bundle, or communicate with third-party open-source components that retain their respective licenses:

| Component | License | Description / Notes |
|:---|:---|:---|
| **QEMU** | **GPL-2.0** | Subprocess hypervisor (`qemu-system-aarch64`); QEMU patches in `tools/qemu-gfxstream/patches/qemu/` are derivative works of QEMU under GPL-2.0 |
| **Android Open Source Project (AOSP)** | **Apache-2.0** / **GPL-2.0** | Cuttlefish virtual device platform, tools (`mkbootimg`), and Linux GKI kernel |
| **Google Platform Tools (ADB)** | **Apache-2.0** | Host-guest communication CLI |
| **Scrcpy** | **Apache-2.0** | Screen mirroring tool |
| **Google SwiftShader & Gfxstream** | **Apache-2.0** | Graphics translation and CPU Vulkan/GLES rasterization |
| **Rutabaga VMM** | **BSD-3-Clause** / **Apache-2.0** | Virtual machine monitor graphics abstraction library |
| **noVNC** | **MPL-2.0** | HTML5 VNC client library |
| **Python (Embedded)** | **PSF License** | Runtime automation environment |

See individual source files, directories, and documentation for third-party notices.
